  "categorias": "Cultura y Espectáculos|Noticias|Sin categoría",
  "post_content": "<p>El cineasta ondense Salva Isert ha grabado este fin de semana su &uacute;ltimo cortometraje, &#39;Tikitik&#39;, en la terraza de La Oveja Negra, enfrente del colegio Mestre Caballero. Ahora est&aacute;n en pleno proceso de post-producci&oacute;n y muy pronto se estrenar&aacute;.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2013/05/IMG_8948.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>Las tres actrices son&nbsp;Iris Prinses, Carol Ohcean y Marta Ramos, y los dos actores Jordi Balaguer Aleixandre y Marcos Fern&aacute;ndez, con la compa&ntilde;&iacute;a de Victoria, Blas, Beatriz y Rosa M. Isert.</p>\n<p>El equipo t&eacute;cnico est&aacute; compuesto por Eduardo Badenas Ondarecords Estudio, &Aacute;ngel Gil, Vanessa Campos, Javi Aguilella, Andr&eacute;s Lobero Urain, V&iacute;ctor Bernat y Cecile Ribalta. La maquilladora era Noem&iacute; Cuadros.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gravaciocurttikitiksalvaisert/img_8928.jpg\" alt=\"img_8928\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gravaciocurttikitiksalvaisert/img_8929.jpg\" alt=\"img_8929\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gravaciocurttikitiksalvaisert/img_8930.jpg\" alt=\"img_8930\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gravaciocurttikitiksalvaisert/img_8931.jpg\" alt=\"img_8931\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gravaciocurttikitiksalvaisert/img_8933.jpg\" alt=\"img_8933\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gravaciocurttikitiksalvaisert/img_8934.jpg\" alt=\"img_8934\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gravaciocurttikitiksalvaisert/img_8935.jpg\" alt=\"img_8935\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gravaciocurttikitiksalvaisert/img_8936.jpg\" alt=\"img_8936\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gravaciocurttikitiksalvaisert/img_8937.jpg\" alt=\"img_8937\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gravaciocurttikitiksalvaisert/img_8939.jpg\" alt=\"img_8939\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gravaciocurttikitiksalvaisert/img_8940.jpg\" alt=\"img_8940\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gravaciocurttikitiksalvaisert/img_8941.jpg\" alt=\"img_8941\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gravaciocurttikitiksalvaisert/img_8942.jpg\" alt=\"img_8942\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gravaciocurttikitiksalvaisert/img_8943.jpg\" alt=\"img_8943\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gravaciocurttikitiksalvaisert/img_8944.jpg\" alt=\"img_8944\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gravaciocurttikitiksalvaisert/img_8946.jpg\" alt=\"img_8946\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gravaciocurttikitiksalvaisert/img_8947.jpg\" alt=\"img_8947\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/gravaciocurttikitiksalvaisert/img_8948.jpg\" alt=\"img_8948\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://